            "text": "{\"task\":{\"created_at\":\"2026-10-27T06:41:20.639193Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-27T06:41:20.639193Z\",\"org_id\":\"01a17c15-5f7f-7106-8654-c58b6f37dca0\",\"project_id\":\"01a17c16-c5f4-7160-ab4f-48e53053e1c4\",\"id\":\"01a17c17-8cfd-73bb-877a-73a2e3cc7dc1\",\"title\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in…\",\"display_index\":5,\"status\":\"pending\",\"kind\":\"eval\",\"member_id\":\"01a17c15-5f9c-7249-9d5e-fb1a6bef6504\",\"automation_id\":null,\"runtime_group_id\":\"01a17c16-d621-7020-b3b9-208d37a3d8f2\",\"runtime_id\":\"01a17c16-dae3-73ed-bf4c-e159b428fe66\",\"is_archived\":false,\"started_at\":null,\"completed_at\":null,\"last_user_message_at\":\"2026-10-27T06:41:20.640693Z\",\"metadata\":{\"error\":null,\"suite\":\"walk\",\"commands\":true,\"agent_name\":\"scripted\",\"task_prompt\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in the shell and reply in one short sentence.\\n\\n<<SCRIPT {\\\"reply\\\":\\\"Echoed the message through hello-mcp and wrote it to the outputs file.\\\",\\\"tools\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hello-mcp_echo\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Echo: hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"command\\\":\\\"echo $WALK_MARKER\\\"}}]}>>\",\"active_run_id\":\"01a17c17-8cfd-73bb-877a-73a16c859691\",\"latest_run_id\":\"01a17c17-8cfd-73bb-877a-73a16c859691\",\"crash_restarts\":null,\"history_recall\":null,\"conversation_id